  "originalText": "[Code Name] Shamare\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] None\n[Place of Birth] Siracusa\n[Date of Birth] Oct 29\n[Race] Vulpo\n[Height] 138cm\n[Infection Status] \nConfirmed Infected by medical examination.",
